 "response": {
  "text": "Indian winters mein **dry skin** ke liye meri first choice **Cetaphil DAM Daily Advance Ultra Hydrating Lotion** rahegi. Isme shea butter, glycerin jaise hydrating ingredients hain aur ye very dry skin ke liye specifically suitable hai. [www.cetaphil.in](https://www.cetaphil.in/skincare-tips/skin-concern/how-to-take-care-of-dry-skin-in-winter.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### [Cetaphil DAM Daily Advance Ultra Hydrating Lotion]()\n*₹208*\n\n### Agar options compare karne hain\n\n### [Cetaphil DAM Daily Advance Ultra Hydrating Lotion]()\n*₹208*\n\n### [CeraVe Moisturising Cream]()\n*₹356*\n\n### [Re'equil Ceramide & Hyaluronic Acid Moisturiser]()\n*₹266*\n\n### [Minimalist Ceramides 0.3% + Madecassoside Moisturizer]()\n*₹529*\n\n- **Very dry / flaky skin:** Cetaphil DAM — safest all-round pick.\n- **Bahut dry + damaged skin barrier:** CeraVe Moisturising Cream — 3 ceramides + hyaluronic acid, fragrance-free. [etadviser.com](https://etadviser.com/beauty/body-care/best-winter-moisturizing-creams-and-lotions-for-dry-skin/articleshow/125521596.cms?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- **Budget-friendly Indian option:** Re'equil Ceramide & Hyaluronic Acid.\n- **Face ke liye lighter option:** Minimalist Ceramides 0.3%.\n\n**Winter tip:** Face wash/bath ke turant baad, skin thodi damp ho tab moisturizer lagao—isse moisture better lock hota hai. Dry/sensitive skin mein fragrance-free moisturizer prefer karna bhi useful hai. [www.cetaphil.in](https://www.cetaphil.in/skincare-tips/skin-concern/how-to-take-care-of-dry-skin-in-winter.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nAgar tum mujhe **apni skin type (dry, oily, combination) + budget (₹300/₹500/₹1000)** bata do, main tumhare liye **1 exact moisturizer** choose kar dunga.",
